ras/64e11a3b8654c6f56bf7a92a78f222f0.avif?t=1757946402\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Unreal Engine 5 guarantees beautiful graphics with stunning environments and scenarios.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/369424ac6b0df8e0d3e72fadd380b483.avif?t=1757946402\" width=1560 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The liminal mode is a walking simulator gamemode for the people that want vhs liminal vibes, no monsters but just unsettling liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/6a4cd33bf578bb72e4bbd7a8e5f13213.poster.avif?t=1757946402\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/6a4cd33bf578bb72e4bbd7a8e5f13213.webm?t=1757946402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/6a4cd33bf578bb72e4bbd7a8e5f13213.mp4?t=1757946402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/extras/d7b20a693c9129ea367c58b98190bd2a.avif?t=1757946402\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use proximity chat to talk to your friends and fully immerse yourself in the experience.</p>","developers":["Rough devs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964500/ad38c7f4a5c056f975a61810203a71271592bb98/header.jpg?t=1757946402","is_free":false,"l